# `.agent` - repo-local agent task contracts

- `tasks/<id>.md` - the task spec (scaffold from `task-template.md`).
- `verifications/<id>.md` - the evidence doc (from `verification-template.md`, or
  `-light` for small work), written before a task is declared done.
- `lenses/` - the review lenses a spec's `lens:` field names.

The canonical copies of the templates and lenses live in
`planning/agent-task/agent-templates/`; the stack conformance check compares these
against them. The dev-loop contract is `planning/agent-task/README.md`.
